<!--
  PROBLEM DOMAIN: Movie catalog.
  The database stores three categories of information:
    1. movies  - the films in the catalog (plus personal viewing data)
    2. people  - directors and actors (one person can be both)
    3. genres  - film genres (reusable descriptions, stored once)
  RELATIONSHIPS (validated by movies.xsd with ID / IDREF / IDREFS):
    movie/@directorid -> person/@id       (IDREF,  exactly one director)
    movie/@actorids   -> person/@id       (IDREFS, one or more actors)
    movie/@genreids   -> genre/@id        (IDREFS, one or more genres)
  MORE INFO:
    more data added to movies (releasedate, budget, boxoffice, profit, age, runtimehours, profitpercent, kind, seasons)
    added personal viewing data to movies (watched, watchdate, myrating)
    more data added to people (birthdate, alive, deathdate, age, moviecount)
-->
